  "2026-11-03T04:21:29.604Z",pi-fleet-sdk-sentinel-1103,"npm test: 957/958 pass. Single failure pre-exists on the pristine Dependabot branch: test/privacy-admission.test.ts asserts scanMutationSecrets detects 10 privacy-corpus entries, but pm-cli 2026.10.30 detects 41. Not caused by the sentinel change; tracked as a separate follow-up item and left out of scope here."
  "2026-11-03T05:40:15.073Z",pi-fleet-sdk-sentinel-1103,"Result: npm test 957/958 pass (one pre-existing privacy-oracle failure, unrelated to sentinels). release:check passes identity/typecheck/lint/duplication/build/docstring and coverage thresholds; it stops at the coverage gate because of that same single pre-existing test failure. Changelog regenerated (no diff: open items are not in released versions)."
